      "created_at": "2020-05-17T16:31:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I saw in the rule book that they have a charge to tell you the effect die result.</p>\n<p>However which die do you roll?&nbsp;<br>\nDo you roll 1 die or roll 3 and pick the MIN/MID/MAX?</p>\n<p>What die do you roll for Overcome?<br>\nWhat die do you roll for Boost/Hinder?<br>\nWhat die do you roll for Recover?</p>\n<p>Thanks</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:47.944Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
