      "raw": "<p>I saw in the rule book that they have a charge to tell you the effect die result.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>However which die do you roll?&nbsp;<br />\r\nDo you roll 1 die or roll 3 and pick the MIN/MID/MAX?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What die do you roll for Overcome?<br />\r\nWhat die do you roll for Boost/Hinder?<br />\r\nWhat die do you roll for Recover?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks</p>",
