    {
      "id": 230750,
      "name": "catDreaming",
      "username": "catDreaming",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-05-17T16:54:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When taking an Action, you always roll three dice: One from a Power, one from a Quality, and one from your Status. If it doesn't tell you what the effect die is for an Action, then it uses the Mid die by default.</p>\n<p>The same applies for Overcome/Boost/Hinder. Recover is a special case, as you normally don't die any dice at all for it.</p>\n<p>Recover can't be used in an action scene unless an Ability says to Recover.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:05:50.088Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 1,
