      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>When taking an Action, you always roll three dice: One from a Power, one from a Quality, and one from your Status. If it doesn't tell you what the effect die is for an Action, then it uses the Mid die by default.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The same applies for Overcome/Boost/Hinder. Recover is a special case, as you normally don't die any dice at all for it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Recover can't be used in an action scene unless an Ability says to Recover.</p>",
