      "created_at": "2020-12-29T17:08:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Reading through the book, because Reactions sometimes say \"roll single X die\" or similar, I read those as exceptions to the general 3-die-pool proceedure, and thus that any Reaction NOT mentioning a single die stuck with the normal proceedure.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
