      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/c68b51/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-12-29T22:10:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>OK, the Reactions that involve rolling are a single die, the ones that don't mention a single die mostly work otherwise, and that's what I was remembering.</p>\n<p>But the fact that it makes specific mention of the \"single die\" each time makes it seem like an exception being noted, rather than a general rule.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
