      "raw": "<p>OK, the Reactions that involve rolling are a single die, the ones that don't mention a single die mostly work otherwise, and that's what I was remembering.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But the fact that it makes specific mention of the \"single die\" each time makes it seem like an exception being noted, rather than a general rule.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
